# Dockerfile-specific context allowlist. Does NOT affect other repo Docker builds.
# Never send workspace secrets, .env files, Git history, app bundles,
# private session/keys or unrelated business assets to the SHARK build.
*
!ops/
!ops/meme/
!ops/meme/*.py
!ops/telegram/
!ops/telegram/*.py
!deploy/
!deploy/shark-public/
!deploy/shark-public/Dockerfile
